# Vendored upstream sources under tools/ are tracked: an environment-level
# `vendor/` ignore rule (e.g. a global gitignore) would otherwise drop them
# from the commit and break `vp check` on a fresh checkout.
!tools/oxlint/anti-slop/vendor/
!tools/oxlint/anti-slop/vendor/**

